# Hromada Strategy Collaboration Mapping

**Product:** candidate МСС agreements (pair · theme · one of 5 Law 1508-VII forms).
Strategy NLP, geo, complementary, explicit-ask, network (and basin underlay) are
**discovery signals**, not IMC types. Spin-out from w3i-network (2026-07-23).
Canonical store: `data/releases/` (local JSON). NocoDB sync archived under
`scripts/legacy/nocodb/`.

**Expert framing (Tkachuk / ІГС, 2026-08 — top practitioner input for this
study):** AI lowers transaction costs and uncertainty and surfaces mutual
benefit; it does **not** replace trust between hromada heads (~60–90% of deals
follow personal contact). Best path to ОТГ heads: **personal contacts / warm
intros**, not cold outreach. Pitch «з ким · про що · навіщо», never «AI замінить
знайомства». Near-term thematic window: **water / basins**. Outreach priority:
ВА ОТГ → ВАГ (not АМУ first). Full notes:
[internal/tkachuk-interview-2026-08.md](../../internal/tkachuk-interview-2026-08.md).

**Frozen local elections (2020→, martial law):** longer tenures densify personal
trust (*sticky heads*) — `mss_network` / known pairs are stronger discovery now;
after future local elections expect *fragile heads*. Do not treat head-pair
networks as permanent. Write-up:
[docs/mss-cooperation-research.md#frozen-elections-otg](../../docs/mss-cooperation-research.md#frozen-elections-otg).

